  "title": "NiSource announces $1.5 billion at-the-market (ATM) equity issuance program through 2028",
  "summary": "MERRILLVILLE, Ind. - NiSource Inc. (NYSE: NI) (&ldquo;NiSource&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo; and &ldquo;our&rdquo;) announced today that it has established an &ldquo;at-the-market&rdquo; equity offering program under which NiSource may sell shares of its common stock, par value $0.01 per share (&ldquo;Common Stock&rdquo;), having an aggregate gross sales price of up to $1.5 billion through December 31, 2028 (the &ldquo;Offering&rdquo;).",
